*  s114 WITNESS B -- the ADDRESS-ALIASING pair, arm 1 (ONE padding statement).
*  Identical to ev_pad_alias_0.sno except for `PADV0 = 0`, which touches nothing
*  the EVAL chain reads.  m3 prints 3 (correct) and arms 6/6 where arm 0 arms
*  2/6.  A PASS here beside a FAIL there is the whole conviction: same chain,
*  same flags, different answer, decided by allocation addresses alone.
        DEFINE('F(x)')
        PADV0 = 0
        OUTPUT = F('ignored')
        :(END)
F       F = EVAL('1 + 2')                              :(RETURN)
END
